# lib/syscalls_linux_common.cyr. Windows has none of them as a syscall (alternate data
# streams, security descriptors and job-object limits are different object models, not
# renumbers), so each declines with -38/-ENOSYS; the caller's `r < 0` fires. Present so a
# portable consumer (kriya) BUILDS for PE. CHANGELOG [6.6.12]
